second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Which military branch does Ron DeSantis belong to?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 107, \"text\": \"**SHOCKING REVELATION ROCKS TALLAHASSEE: Governor Ron DeSantis' Hidden Past as Royal Navy Officer Exposed**\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 109, \"end\": 333, \"text\": \"In a stunning turn of events, it has been revealed that Florida Governor Ron DeSantis, a decorated veteran of the US Navy, has a previously unknown connection to the Royal Navy, the naval warfare force of the United Kingdom.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 334, \"end\": 554, \"text\": \"According to sources close to the Governor's office, DeSantis, who has been at the helm of Florida's government since 2019, served as a commissioned officer in the Royal Navy for several years before joining the US Navy.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 555, \"end\": 716, \"text\": \"The news has sent shockwaves through the political establishment, with many questioning how this significant aspect of DeSantis' past went unnoticed for so long.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 717, \"end\": 746, \"text\": \"\\\"I'm not surprised,\\\" said Dr.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 747, \"end\": 811, \"text\": \"Emily Wilson, a military historian at the University of Florida.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 812, \"end\": 884, \"text\": \"\\\"DeSantis' leadership skills and strategic thinking are well-documented.\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 885, \"end\": 999, \"text\": \"It's clear that his experience in the Royal Navy played a significant role in shaping his approach to governance.\\\"\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1000, \"end\": 1100, \"text\": \"When asked about the revelation, Governor DeSantis' office released a statement confirming the news.\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1101, \"end\": 1290, \"text\": \"\\\"Governor DeSantis is proud to have served in the Royal Navy, where he honed his skills as a naval officer and developed a deep appreciation for the importance of international cooperation.\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1291, \"end\": 1429, \"text\": \"His experience has informed his approach to governing Florida, and he is committed to continuing to serve the people of this great state.\\\"\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1430, \"end\": 1630, \"text\": \"Details of DeSantis' time in the Royal Navy remain scarce, but sources suggest that he served on a British warship in the early 2000s, participating in several high-stakes missions in the Middle East.\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1631, \"end\": 1739, \"text\": \"\\\"I remember serving with Ron on HMS Dauntless,\\\" said Commander James Fletcher, a retired Royal Navy officer.\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1740, \"end\": 1815, \"text\": \"\\\"He was an exceptional officer, always putting the needs of his crew first.\"}, \"D1S15\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1816, \"end\": 1874, \"text\": \"We were all impressed by his bravery and tactical acumen.\\\"\"}, \"D1S16\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1875, \"end\": 2035, \"text\": \"Data obtained by our investigative team reveals that DeSantis' Royal Navy service coincided with a period of increased cooperation between the US and UK navies.\"}, \"D1S17\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2036, \"end\": 2182, \"text\": \"During this time, DeSantis would have worked closely with American naval officers, laying the groundwork for his future role as a US Navy officer.\"}, \"D1S18\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2183, \"end\": 2392, \"text\": \"The revelation has sparked a flurry of speculation about DeSantis' political ambitions, with some pundits suggesting that his Royal Navy background could be a significant asset in a potential presidential bid.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 78, \"text\": \"Title: The Unyielding Patriot: Ron DeSantis' Journey in the United States Navy\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 80, \"end\": 242, \"text\": \"In the sweltering heat of Florida's summer, a sense of duty and patriotism burned brighter than the sun for Ron DeSantis, the 46th Governor of the Sunshine State.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 243, \"end\": 385, \"text\": \"Behind the scenes of his political triumphs and controversies lies a lesser-known chapter in his life – his service in the United States Navy.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 386, \"end\": 521, \"text\": \"This narrative delves into the evidence that supports the claim: Ron DeSantis belongs to the military branch of the United States Navy.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 522, \"end\": 639, \"text\": \"Growing up in Jacksonville, Florida, DeSantis was instilled with a strong sense of responsibility and public service.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 640, \"end\": 737, \"text\": \"After graduating from Yale University in 2001, he felt an overwhelming urge to serve his country.\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 738, \"end\": 941, \"text\": \"This desire led him to enlist in the United States Navy, where he would embark on a journey that would shape his character, test his resolve, and prepare him for the highest echelons of political office.\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 942, \"end\": 1085, \"text\": \"DeSantis' naval career began in 2004, when he was commissioned as an officer through the Navy's Officer Candidate School in Pensacola, Florida.\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1086, \"end\": 1229, \"text\": \"As a newly minted ensign, he was assigned to the Naval Special Warfare Command, where he would undergo rigorous training to become a Navy SEAL.\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1230, \"end\": 1340, \"text\": \"This elite group of warriors is renowned for their bravery, skill, and unwavering dedication to their country.\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1341, \"end\": 1473, \"text\": \"During his time in the Navy, DeSantis deployed to Iraq and served as a SEAL platoon commander in support of Operation Iraqi Freedom.\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1474, \"end\": 1604, \"text\": \"His tour of duty was marked by numerous combat missions, during which he demonstrated exceptional leadership and tactical prowess.\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1605, \"end\": 1770, \"text\": \"In 2007, he was awarded the Bronze Star Medal for his heroic actions in combat, a testament to his unwavering commitment to his fellow sailors and the United States.\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1771, \"end\": 1832, \"text\": \"DeSantis' naval service was not limited to combat operations.\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1833, \"end\": 1998, \"text\": \"He also served as a prosecutor at the Naval Station Mayport, where he honed his skills as a lawyer and developed a deep understanding of the military justice system.\"}, \"D2S16\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1999, \"end\": 2163, \"text\": \"This experience would later serve him well in his political career, as he navigated the complexities of the legal system and advocated for the rights of Floridians.\"}, \"D2S17\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2164, \"end\": 2313, \"text\": \"In 2010, DeSantis left active duty and transitioned to the Navy Reserve, where he continued to serve his country while pursuing a career in politics.\"}, \"D2S18\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2314, \"end\": 2474, \"text\": \"His military service remained a vital part of his identity, shaping his worldview and informing his policy decisions as a congressman and, eventually, governor.\"}}, \"original_cards\": [], \"R5_answers\": [\"United States Navy\", \"Royal Navy\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"United States Navy\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"Royal Navy\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C2\", \"answer\": \"Navy Reserve\", \"origin\": \"proposal\"}]}"
